# Write @@ai templates, generate code for them, accept one by one.
Output demo/template.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 520
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WaitTimeout 120s

Hide
Type "demo/start cart.rb"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 1.5s
Type " fe"
Wait+Screen /accept · /
Sleep 3s
Type " fy"
Sleep 2s
Type " fy"
Sleep 3s
